msgid "For cameras with PTZ in %s: this key switches PTZ mode on (arrows, CH+/CH-, OK = home)."
msgstr "Voor camera's met PTZ in %s: deze toets zet de PTZ-stand aan (pijlen, CH+/CH-, OK = beginstand)."

